    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbindung testen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That did not work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das hat nicht geklappt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API password is the older sign-in method. Newer Kimai versions only accept API tokens, which you create in Kimai under your profile › API access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das API-Passwort ist die ältere Anmeldemethode. Neuere Kimai-Versionen akzeptieren nur noch API-Tokens, die du in Kimai unter deinem Profil › API-Zugang erstellst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API token could not be saved to the Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das API-Token konnte nicht im Schlüsselbund gespeichert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Kimai server cannot be reached. Check the address and your network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Kimai-Server ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfe die Adresse und dein Netzwerk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection failed while “%@” was being stopped. Check in Kimai whether it is still running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung ist abgebrochen, während „%@“ gestoppt wurde. Prüfe in Kimai, ob der Timer noch läuft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end has to be after the start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Ende muss nach dem Start liegen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The entry will be removed from Kimai. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Eintrag wird aus Kimai entfernt. Das lässt sich nicht widerrufen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new timer is running, but the previous one could not be ended cleanly: %@ Please check its end time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der neue Timer läuft, aber der vorherige konnte nicht sauber beendet werden: %@ Bitte prüfe dessen Endzeit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request was cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Anfrage wurde abgebrochen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The running timer will be stopped at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der laufende Timer wird um %@ gestoppt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server address is not valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Serveradresse ist ungültig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server did not answer like Kimai. Check the server address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server hat nicht wie Kimai geantwortet. Prüfe die Serveradresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The start you chose is before the running timer began (%@). Choose a later start, or stop the running timer first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der gewählte Start liegt vor dem Beginn des laufenden Timers (%@). Wähle einen späteren Start oder stoppe zuerst den laufenden Timer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time zone of your Kimai profile is not known yet, so times cannot be saved reliably. Check the connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Zeitzone deines Kimai-Profils ist noch nicht bekannt, deshalb lassen sich Zeiten nicht zuverlässig speichern. Prüfe die Verbindung und versuche es erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timer is stopped at the time you choose. Cancel keeps the timer running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Timer wird zur gewählten Zeit gestoppt. Mit „Abbrechen“ läuft er weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timer “%@” kept running since %@. What should happen with the time you were away?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Timer „%1$@“ lief seit %2$@ weiter. Was soll mit der Zeit deiner Abwesenheit geschehen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is offline. Timers can only be started, stopped or changed while Kimai is reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Mac ist offline. Timer lassen sich nur starten, stoppen oder ändern, wenn Kimai erreichbar ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Week": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Woche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This entry was exported. Kimai may refuse changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Eintrag wurde exportiert. Kimai lehnt Änderungen möglicherweise ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timer": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Times are shown in this Mac's time zone (%@). Your Kimai profile uses %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeiten werden in der Zeitzone dieses Macs angezeigt (%1$@). Dein Kimai-Profil verwendet %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tracking is stopped: “%@” was ended at %@ and could not be continued automatically. Start it again to keep tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Zeiterfassung ist gestoppt: „%1$@“ wurde um %2$@ beendet und konnte nicht automatisch fortgesetzt werden. Starte die Aufgabe erneut, um weiter zu erfassen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benutzername"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name and API password": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benutzername und API-Passwort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you working on?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Woran arbeitest du?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What did you work on?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Woran hast du gearbeitet?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When did you start?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wann hast du angefangen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When did you stop working?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wann hast du aufgehört zu arbeiten?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you come back, you decide whether the time away stays on the timer. Nothing is removed automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn ein Timer läuft, entscheidest du nach deiner Rückkehr, ob die Abwesenheit mitgezählt wird. Zeiten werden nie automatisch entfernt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without https the token is sent unencrypted. Use this only on a network you trust.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne https wird das Token unverschlüsselt übertragen. Nutze das nur in einem Netzwerk, dem du vertraust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You were away for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du warst %@ weg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Kimai account is not allowed to do this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Kimai-Konto darf das nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS did not allow this. Move Kimai Timer to the Applications folder and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS hat das nicht erlaubt. Bewege Kimai Timer in den Ordner „Programme“ und versuche es erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "since %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "seit %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” (%@) will be removed from Kimai. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%1$@“ (%2$@) wird aus Kimai entfernt. Das lässt sich nicht widerrufen."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
